  "statement": "Sustainability is vital for the library management system, as it impacts both environmental and operational efficiency. My requirements focus on reducing energy consumption (GRN-01), providing energy usage reports (GRN-02), and minimizing paper waste through digital notifications (GRN-03). Additionally, assessing the carbon footprint of books (GRN-04) and implementing recycling programs (GRN-05) contribute to responsible resource management. However, I see potential conflicts with EfficiencyAgent's EFF-02, which proposes allowing up to 10 simultaneous borrow operations per member, potentially increasing energy usage and resource strain.",
